{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新研究發現，大約2000年前，地球北極地區的一塊古老冰蓋殘餘開始重新擴張，這可能意味着地球已經啓動了下一輪冰期的早期進程。然而，隨着人類工業化發展、温室氣體排放持續增加，全球氣温不斷上升，這一擴張趨勢最終在20世紀中葉發生逆轉。研究人員認為，人類活動可能已經中斷了地球長期以來相當規律的冰期循環。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584150.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:52.642826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:28:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_hash":"b99095aec07b12ac8650da8f56033175579f6b5a6257d92e4a9570b45bdaa24e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}